# OMEN Steam install (Void nonfree) - GATED behind gate-12 bench POST receipt.
# Console-safe: one command per line, no chaining. Root section assumes a root shell already.

# --- ROOT ---
id -u
xbps-install -S
xbps-query -L
xbps-install -y steam

# --- USER sd: receipts + first launch ---
xbps-query steam
steam

# Notes:
# - xbps-query -L must list nonfree (it does if nvidia came from nonfree); if missing, add
#   the nonfree repo conf first (operator gate, separate wave).
# - Games live on /fast/steam or /mnt/games (STATE.md disk map); ~/Downloads is a symlink to
#   /mnt/games/Downloads, use find -L when hunting installs (MASTER lessons).
# - Fallback if the native client fights the beauty stack: flatpak install com.valvesoftware.Steam
#   (system flatpak already in use for Vesktop).
# - Proton comes from Steam itself; the parked games campaign stays PARKED (2026-08-25).

# --- ROLLBACK (root): xbps-remove -y steam ---
